& [PlanStatus] is formation_authorized_execution_forbidden

& [Purpose] close one preserved-source audit-basis reference without overwriting Revision 1 history or changing implementation authority

& [Step1_SourcePreservation] create a new erratum source package
  + cite the immutable 4952-byte Revision 1 source and exact wrong audit_basis value
  + cite actual I03D canonical path bytes digest and introduction commit
  + state whether the correction changes only reference identity or also changes a semantic clause
  + never modify the original source or source manifest

& [Step2_SJSInputAudit] independently remeasure both identities and the chronology
  + rescan every tracked SOP annotation path
  + require exactly one known missing predecessor reference and zero additional unexplained missing targets
  + verify actual I03D canonical existed before Revision 1 and still has its bound digest
  + refuse processing if intended target is ambiguous or has drifted

& [Step3_DecisionGate] select one successor form
  + use a companion erratum only when no Revision 1 semantic behavior requirement source touch or authority boundary changes
  + use a superseding Revision 2 when any semantic clause requirement test gate or implementation boundary changes
  + record why the unselected form would be inaccurate

& [Step4_CanonicalFormation] process the chosen source through semantic refinement constraints data design and canonical plus exploded representation
  + bind wrong source identity actual target identity and non-overwrite rule
  + make the erratum or revision a mandatory conjunct of future I03A authority
  + create no Cargo Rust dependency test host execution or production surface

& [Step5_RequirementAndLockFormation] create independently reviewable correction requirements and an inactive lock candidate
  + require source exactness referential closure chronology semantic non-expansion and supersession behavior
  + implementation and verification remain zero
  + activation signature and active-lock counts remain zero

& [Step6_ReviewAndReaudit] run all seven faculties and repeat source lock canonical header requirement evidence and handoff audits
  + update package carrier and requirement totals only from the accepted successor form
  + retain prior audits under their measured baseline and scope
  + do not claim that external host or signing authority is resolved

& [Step7_Reentry] return to the host protocol first revalidation step
  + only an accepted exact correction may close the internal source-reference blocker
  + organization-authorized host path and separate I03A implementation authority remain later independent prerequisites

& [StopRules] are fail closed
  + ambiguity target drift semantic expansion source overwrite missing carrier unsigned correction evidence fault or scope change stops formation
  + a guessed alias filesystem redirect symbolic link copied file or textual explanation cannot substitute for governed correction

& [Forbidden] is original-source edit Cargo mutation Rust implementation dependency admission compilation test execution host attempt signing change validation runtime provider model persistence network production hardware FPGA or shared inference
& [Disposition] is next_static_work_defined_erratum_not_formed
